# Keep the deployed upload to what the API actually needs at runtime.
# Note: Vercel traces dependencies from api/index.js, so the Firebase
# entry (index.js) and its firebase-admin/firebase-functions tree are
# already left out of the function bundle — it is unreachable from the
# Vercel entry. It stays in the upload so `main` in package.json keeps
# resolving; only genuinely local artefacts are excluded here.

node_modules
.env
.env.*
*.log
.gcloudignore
